  "summary": "Added pause to src/main.ts. P toggles it while the game is `playing`. While paused, the sliding slab and falling debris stop, and Space and canvas clicks do nothing. A \"Paused\" label appears in the HUD and the hint text now lists P. `window.__TASK_STATE__` now includes `paused: boolean`. R restarts and clears the pause. Typecheck passes. I did not render or play it in a browser after this change, so the pause behavior itself is untested. P does nothing once the game is won or lost, and the status text stays `playing` while paused."
